kind: manual
description: |
  The Arabic fonts: IBM Plex Sans Arabic, Tajawal, Noto Naskh Arabic and
  Noto Kufi Arabic, all under the SIL Open Font License.  The font files of
  the Google Fonts repository, pinned to one commit and by checksum each;
  installed in /usr/share/fonts/<family>, with their licenses.

build-depends:
- bootstrap/build-env.bst

